  "text": "o yq\n\nsample text lesson (start here!)\nthis is a sample text lesson! text lessons let you use formatted text, so you can use written lessons\nas part of your course, but they also support adding images and embeds.\nalong with file uploads, this lesson type will be the most common one you use in your courses.\nfor example:\n\n¢ this is a bullet point\n\n¢ this is a bolded bullet\n\nthis bullet is bolded and italicized\n\n« this text is larger than normal\n\n® this text is smaller than normal\nyou can type \"/\" to format text and add images or embeds.\nfor example, here's an image of one of the worksheets in podia's course \"get noticed!\" (which you\nget free access to as part of your podia plan).\n\nget | lesson1.1\n\nnoticed! : audience growth map and contact list\n\neasiesttoreach seesssssssssscnsansanas . ] ] .\n\n> m0. immediate family and friends\nacquaintances\n& warm connectors\n§\nnc)\n",
